message: "If you use ZettelGeist in your research, please cite it as below."
title: ZettelGeist
abstract: >-
  ZettelGeist is a plaintext, historiographically focused notetaking system.
  Notes are YAML or Markdown-with-frontmatter files; they are indexed into a
  SQLite full-text-search database and queried through ZQL, a small query
  language.
